---
import { ArrowRightIcon, UserIcon } from "@lucide/astro"
---

<section id="about" class="space-y-6">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-x-4">
    <UserIcon size="20" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">about</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-prose space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-pretty">
    <p class="drop-cap">
      I'm a computer science graduate from Chennai with an AI specialisation, and a core team member of the Google
      Developer Student Club on campus. I design interfaces and then build them — most recently the official portal of
      the Indian National Car Racing Championship, and a multi-disease diagnosis framework built on TensorFlow.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of what I make sits at the seam of interface, intelligence and hardware: Next.js and React on the front,
      Python underneath, and the occasional IoT board on the desk. Online I go by Arkhins — an anagram of Krishna.
    </p>

    <p>
      If any of that resonates,
      <a href="/#contact">
        get in touch
        <ArrowRightIcon size="14" stroke-width="1.5" class="inline" />
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
